# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated data and trained models are NOT committed: ~203 MB, and every byte of it
# is reproducible with `python run_all.py`. The generators are seeded, so a fresh run
# reproduces the exact datasets and metrics quoted in the READMEs and REPORT.md.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/data/
*/models/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reports ARE committed (~2 MB). The figures are the evidence REPORT.md refers to, so
# excluding them would leave the report's figure references broken on GitHub, and the
# metrics JSON is small enough to be genuinely useful in a diff.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

